  <section|Citations>

  This document cites entries of the file <verbatim|bibliography.bib>,
  which lies next to it, and lets the bibliography be generated in the
  <verbatim|tm-plain> style. Line breaking is due to Knuth and
  Plass<nbsp><cite|knuth1981>, and the algorithm is described in the
  <TeX>book<nbsp><cite|knuth1984>. <LaTeX> is documented
  in<nbsp><cite|lamport1994>, and <TeXmacs> in<nbsp><cite|vdh2001>.
  Several entries may be cited at once<nbsp><cite|knuth1984|lamport1994>,
  and a citation may carry a detail<nbsp><cite-detail|knuth1984|chapter 14>.
  An entry which is never cited does not appear in the bibliography.

